{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30395","headline":"回於道中寄舒州李珏相公 · 赵嘏","name":"回於道中寄舒州李珏相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都无鄙吝隔尘埃，昨日丘门避席来。\n静语乍临清庙瑟，披风如在九层台。\n几烦命妓浮溪棹，再许论诗注酒杯。\n从此微尘知感恋，七真台上望三台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30395.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30395","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}